WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:06.200
Report to Your Highness I never expected huaicheng's commander Lu Yuan he was actually once.

00:06.280 --> 00:11.880
Master Yugong's student master Yugong after being exiled was saved by Lu Yuan.

00:11.960 --> 00:15.640
And cared for his teacher until the end this Lu Yuan.

00:15.720 --> 00:21.000
Has always been grateful for Your Highness saving his teacher this time, hearing Your Highness's royal army has returned.

00:21.080 --> 00:24.920
He actually opened the gates and personally welcomed the royal army.

00:29.280 --> 00:30.680
Master Yu.

00:32.280 --> 00:33.960
I never thought even now.

00:35.320 --> 00:36.720
You're still helping me.

00:41.600 --> 00:43.000
What a pity.

00:43.800 --> 00:45.800
Couldn't see you one more time.

